---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Mind — The 4M Framework | My4MLife"
  description="Mind is the destination of the 4M framework. Sharper cognition, better sleep, lower stress load, and clearer purpose — protected for the long run."
  canonical="https://www.my4mlife.com/pillars/mind"
  keywords="cognitive health, brain optimization, sleep quality, stress resilience, nootropic peptides, My4MLife Mind pillar"
  ogImage="https://www.my4mlife.com/og-image.svg"
  robots="index, follow"
>

<!-- ===== HERO ===== -->
<section class="pillar-hero pillar-hero--mind">
  <div class="pillar-hero-bg" aria-hidden="true">
    <img src="/images/scenes/mind-contemplative.jpg" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
    <div class="pillar-hero-overlay"></div>
  </div>
    <div class="container pillar-hero-inner">
    <p class="pillar-kicker">PILLAR 1 OF 4 — MIND</p>
    <h1>Mind</h1>
    <p class="pillar-tagline"><em>The mind is what we're protecting.</em></p>
    <p class="pillar-value">
      Every decision you make, every protocol you follow, every behavioral change you sustain — it all serves one destination. A sharper, more resilient mind. Not just today. At 60. At 70. At 80. That is the entire point of the 4M system.
    </p>
    <p class="pillar-value">
      Mind is both the starting point and the finish line. Begin here — with clarity about what you're protecting — and every other pillar finds its purpose.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== FRAMEWORK ROLE ===== -->
<section class="pillar-section pillar-section--light">
  <div class="container pillar-prose">
    <h2>The Role of Mind in the 4M Framework</h2>
    <p>
      Mind is both the start and the end of the 4M cycle. Begin with the end in mind. Every other pillar serves this destination — sharper cognition, better sleep architecture, lower stress load, clearer purpose. Muscle builds the physical infrastructure the brain requires. Mitigate removes the chronic insults driving neuroinflammation. Motivate sustains the compliance that makes the other three work. All roads lead back here.
    </p>
    <p>
      The research on cognitive longevity is no longer ambiguous. The drivers of cognitive aging — gut inflammation, hormonal decline, environmental toxin load, sleep debt, sedentary behavior, chronic psychological stress — are modifiable. The window to act is not retirement. It is now, while the architecture can still be shaped. The My4MLife program exists because that window closes, and most men don't realize it until it has.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== SUB-TOPICS ===== -->
<section class="pillar-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Sub-Topics Under the Mind Pillar</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Five focus areas — each with its own solution pathway inside My4MLife.</p>
    <div class="subtopic-grid">

      <div class="subtopic-card">
        <h3>Cognitive Function &amp; Focus</h3>
        <p>Brain fog, word-finding gaps, and processing speed loss are early signals — not inevitable aging. Act on them before the architecture degrades.</p>
        <a href="/solutions/cognitive" class="explore-link">Explore &rarr;</a>
      </div>

      <div class="subtopic-card">
        <h3>Sleep Quality &amp; Recovery</h3>
        <p>The glymphatic system clears amyloid and metabolic waste during deep sleep only. Poor sleep is the fastest single lever for accelerating cognitive decline.</p>
        <a href="/solutions/sleep" class="explore-link">Explore &rarr;</a>
      </div>

      <div class="subtopic-card">
        <h3>Stress &amp; Resilience</h3>
        <p>Chronic cortisol elevation literally shrinks the hippocampus. Resilience isn't a mindset — it's a measurable physiological state that can be trained.</p>
        <a href="/solutions/stress" class="explore-link">Explore &rarr;</a>
      </div>

      <div class="subtopic-card">
        <h3>Lack of Purpose &amp; Goals</h3>
        <p>Purposelessness is a cognitive risk factor. Men without a clear future orientation show accelerated cognitive decline — identity and vision are brain health.</p>
        <a href="/solutions/purpose-goals" class="explore-link">Explore &rarr;</a>
      </div>

      <div class="subtopic-card">
        <h3>Brain Optimization Tools</h3>
        <p>The Connected Mind cognitive screen, Dual N-Back training, and nootropic peptide protocols (Semax, Selank, BPC-157) form the active intervention layer.</p>
        <a href="/solutions/peptides" class="explore-link">Explore &rarr;</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== APP DELIVERY ===== -->
<section class="pillar-section pillar-section--dark">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>How the My4MLife App Delivers the Mind Pillar</h2>
    <p class="app-intro">Daily cognitive load and recovery protocols, weekly meditation and breathing tracking, audit-driven priority focus — all inside the app.</p>
    <div class="tier-delivery-grid">
      <div class="tier-delivery-card">
        <div class="tier-badge tier-badge--free">Protégé — Active Member</div>
        <p>Full Discovery audit to identify your primary cognitive risk factors. Daily gut-brain protocol. Morning routine tracker. Connected Mind baseline assessment. Weekly cognitive load tracking, breathing and HRV protocols, Dual N-Back access, weekly group Zoom with Dr. TJ. Activated by any My4MLife purchase.</p>
        <a href="/membership" class="tier-link">Learn more &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="tier-delivery-card">
        <div class="tier-badge tier-badge--grad">Graduate</div>
        <p>Earned after 12+ continuous months of active subscription. Lifetime protocol library access, permanent app access, and ongoing member benefits — even if the subscription later lapses.</p>
        <a href="/membership" class="tier-link">Learn more &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== CTAs ===== -->
<section class="pillar-section pillar-cta-section">
  <div class="container pillar-cta-inner">
    <h2>Your Solution Path</h2>
    <div class="cta-chain">
      <a href="/assessment" class="cta-btn cta-btn--primary">Take the Free Assessment &rarr;</a>
      <a href="https://app.my4mlife.com" class="cta-btn cta-btn--outline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download the My4MLife App — Free &rarr;</a>
      <a href="/consult" class="cta-btn cta-btn--outline">Schedule a Comprehensive 4M Consult &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== DISCLAIMER ===== -->
<section class="pillar-disclaimer">
  <div class="container">
    <p>My4MLife is a lifestyle and wellness education platform. Content on this page is for informational purposes only and does not constitute medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. All clinical services, including Rx protocols and telemedicine consultations, are delivered by a separately contracted, fully licensed telemedicine practice operating under its own professional obligations. Results vary. Always consult a qualified healthcare provider before beginning any new health protocol.</p>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
/* ── Shared pillar tokens ── */
.pillar-hero {
  padding: 9rem 0 6rem;
  text-align: center;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.pillar-hero-bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; }
.pillar-hero-bg img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
.pillar-hero-overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(10,22,40,0.88) 0%, rgba(26,58,92,0.78) 50%, rgba(15,76,117,0.85) 100%); }
.pillar-hero--mind {
  background: linear-gradient(160deg, #0a1628 0%, #0f4c75 55%, #1a3a5c 100%);
}
.pillar-hero-inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.pillar-kicker {
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #c8a84b;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
.pillar-hero h1 {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 4rem;
  color: white;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
.pillar-tagline {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
  margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
}
.pillar-value {
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
  max-width: 680px;
  margin: 0 auto 1.2rem;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

/* ── Sections ── */
.pillar-section { padding: 5.5rem 0; }
.pillar-section--light { background: var(--bg-soft); }
.pillar-section--dark {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a1628 0%, #0f4c75 100%);
}
.pillar-prose h2,
.pillar-section h2 {
  font-size: 2rem;
  margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
  color: var(--dark);
}
.pillar-section--dark h2 { color: white; }
.pillar-prose p { margin-bottom: 1.2rem; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.8; }
.section-sub { color: var(--text-light); margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }

/* ── Sub-topic cards ── */
.subtopic-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 1.5rem;
}
.subtopic-card {
  background: white;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 1.8rem 1.5rem;
  transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
}
.subtopic-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-3px);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  border-color: var(--accent);
}
.subtopic-card h3 {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  color: var(--primary);
  margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
}
.subtopic-card p {
  font-size: 0.88rem;
  color: var(--text-light);
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
.explore-link {
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--accent);
  text-decoration: none;
}
.explore-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

/* ── Tier delivery ── */
.app-intro {
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
  font-size: 1rem;
  margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  max-width: 600px;
}
.tier-delivery-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 1.5rem;
}
.tier-delivery-card {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 1.8rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 1rem;
}
.tier-delivery-card p {
  font-size: 0.88rem;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
  line-height: 1.7;
  flex: 1;
}
.tier-badge {
  display: inline-block;
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
  border-radius: 20px;
  width: fit-content;
}
.tier-badge--free { background: rgba(0,184,148,0.15); color: var(--accent); }
.tier-badge--insider { background: rgba(226,184,74,0.15); color: #e2b84a; }
.tier-badge--grad { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); }
.tier-link {
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--accent);
  text-decoration: none;
}
.tier-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

/* ── CTAs ── */
.pillar-cta-section { background: var(--bg-soft); text-align: center; }
.pillar-cta-inner h2 { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
.cta-chain {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 1rem;
}
.cta-btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
  border-radius: 50px;
  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: all 0.25s;
}
.cta-btn--primary {
  background: var(--accent);
  color: white;
}
.cta-btn--primary:hover {
  background: var(--accent-dark);
  transform: translateY(-1px);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,184,148,0.4);
}
.cta-btn--outline {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--primary);
  border: 2px solid var(--primary);
}
.cta-btn--outline:hover {
  background: var(--primary);
  color: white;
}

/* ── Disclaimer ── */
.pillar-disclaimer {
  background: #f7fafc;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 2rem 0;
}
.pillar-disclaimer p {
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  color: var(--text-light);
  line-height: 1.7;
  max-width: 880px;
}

/* ── Responsive ── */
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .subtopic-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .tier-delivery-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; max-width: 440px; margin: 0 auto; }
}
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .pillar-hero { padding: 7rem 0 4rem; }
  .pillar-hero h1 { font-size: 2.8rem; }
  .subtopic-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
</style>
